Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 07:16:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Correct the brand tags, and start the welcome automation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Signups from the app now carry farmhousegetaways as well as app and
source-app-more. The app really is all three brands at once, which is why it
had no brand tag — but a contact with no brand tag is quietly left out of every
branded send, and being in the wrong segment is easier to notice and fix than
being in none. EMAILOCTOPUS_BRAND overrides it.

Also queues the welcome email that carries the map, when an automation id is
configured, and syncs _lib/emailoctopus.mjs with the farmhousegetaways copy it
is a duplicate of.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EdLDnYDQAnsHQoCsr8K2Rx
